"<b><small>Note: Installing or upgrading language packs can trigger the "
"installation of additional languages</small></b>"
msgstr ""
"<b><small>Let wel: Die installering of opgradering van taalpakke kan die "
"installering van bykomende tale veroorsaak</small></b>"

